    "course_code": "CS571",
    "course_description": "Introduces software development of user interfaces (UIs). Build competence in implementing UIs using state-of-the-art UI paradigms, capturing and responding to different forms of user input, and utilizing platform-specific UI development APIs, frameworks, and tools.",
